{"text": "Travis and the other travelers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Returned safely to the machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And found Eckels inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You put all of us in danger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Travis to Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In an angry voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You left the path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am sorry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I did not kill anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is only a little mud. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On my shoes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Travis stared at Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a long time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without saying anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lets go home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Travis finally. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The machine stopped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They all returned to the present safely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is everything okay here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fine, Welcome home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Mister Parker.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "r", "a", "v", "i", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "R", "e", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "s", "a", "f", "e", "l", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "i", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "u", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "d", "a", "n", "g", "e", "r"